     7	3. **重要难例：同一篇文章同时提出两个年度，现有续期路径接不上。** v38 的 [match record 14](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/poc/data/english-v38-nvda-1w-2026-10-28/views.sqlite) 中，`c1` 和 `c2` 分别问同一组云厂商的 2026、2027 年资本开支，两者都判为新开，成为 `v8`、`v9`。[标准第 317 行](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:317)把同一量的下一期间列为续期；但[代码第 289–293 行](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/views/matching.py:289)不允许候选续期到同一答案中的另一个候选。H2 讨论的是事件截止日，H1–H7 没有覆盖这个同篇年度接续的情形。G1 应明确标出这对的预期关系，并核对实际是否记录了该关系。
     8	
     9	4. **事实错误：M4 把续期归因于碰撞裁决，证据不足。** [计划第 82 行](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:82)说裁决判“下一期”，代码因此续期。但 v38 的 [match record 24](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/poc/data/english-v38-nvda-1w-2026-10-28/views.sqlite)显示 Jev 自己也判了 `same_quantity_other_period`；[代码第 284–297 行](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/views/jev_matching.py:284)在碰撞裁决前就可据此选续期，后面的裁决只保留了该结果。这个案例证明发生了续期，不能单独证明碰撞裁决造成了续期。
    10	
    11	第 4 轮的结构规则**已补上**所指出的续期题、续期证据和到期后测试缺口；它也能在候选进入 G1 时发现错误合并和必需题丢失。上面的拒绝结局说明它还不能声称覆盖所有结局。两臂共同存在的绝对归档损失按要求留给 D212 审计。
    12	
    13	核对过的主要事实包括：两本账的候选、合并和续期总数与[普查输出](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/census/admission-census.txt:1)一致；“担保和融资”确在[签字标准第 318 行](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:318)和碰撞提示词中，计划也已正确说明其是否导致 ACP 拆题尚未证明。H1–H7 的主要边界现已标为选择，H7 的倾向与 [D204](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2612)一致。裁决类别数仍依赖解析理由文字；我没有逐条验证全部归档裁决、费用估算和计划中的每一项事实。没有编辑文件。
    14	
    15	**有严重问题仍需修正。**     1	**Serious findings remain.** The per-candidate check can catch a false merge or a lost required question when that candidate is in G1, but it does not yet cover every relevant outcome or every evidence loss.
     2	
     3	1. **Serious — the round-5 fix still misses directly filed evidence that both arms lose.** The plan checks direct evidence only when its destination changes against the control ([plan line 157](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:157)). If both runs drop the same required statement, there is no changed destination to inspect. Placement can drop an unfiled statement before matching ([placement.py line 53](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/placement.py:53); [extraction.py line 608](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/extraction.py:608)). The earlier audit recorded a case where the revenue page was present but a revenue statement was not filed there ([audit line 49](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-28-retention-audit/results.md:49)). That audit’s labels are not signed gold, but the example shows the gap. Required direct evidence needs an expected outcome independent of the control.
     4	
     5	2. **Serious — the holdout does not specify how its existing questions come into being.** The plan says to run only extraction and placement for the new September week ([plan lines 133–134](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:133)). Placement needs the questions open at that article’s turn; matching and writing create those questions ([round.py lines 103–130](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/views/round.py:103)). Without a defined starting ledger and a way to advance it, the holdout cannot establish the comparisons and evidence destinations G1 is meant to judge.
     6	
     7	3. **Serious — the claimed closed set omits a real refusal outcome.** G1 says every ledger candidate is either its own question, the same as another, or a successor ([plan lines 107–115](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:107)). In the read-only [v38 ledger](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/poc/data/english-v38-nvda-1w-2026-10-28/views.sqlite), item `gnews:6ab3379f10dfeb28924ebb57` has two candidates with the same question text; `n1` was refused because its object was outside the research universe. The product contract permits that refusal ([PRD 06 line 178](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/06-views.md:178)). “Same question” and “not worth opening” do not record why this candidate was correctly refused. Thus the round-4 structural rule covers the named successor cases, but is **not yet a complete closed set**.
     8	
     9	4. **Serious — re-sampling placement makes the matching comparison ambiguous.** The plan says score changes come only from matching, while also re-sending placement because its list changes ([plan lines 144–147](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:144)). Placement is a model call ([placement.py lines 59–70](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/placement.py:59)); a different placement answer can change evidence even with the same question list. The earlier audit explicitly says duplicate pages causing placement misses was **not proven** ([audit line 66](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-28-retention-audit/results.md:66)). The comparison therefore needs to distinguish matching’s effect from placement variation before attributing a score change.
    10	
    11	The central source checks support several corrections already made. The guarantee/financing sentence is in both the [signed standard](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:318) and the [collision prompt](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/src/hivemind/prompts/collision-v1.txt:1); its causing the ACP split remains unproven, as the plan now says. H1–H7 identify their principal changes as choices, and H7’s lean agrees with [D204](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2609). The displayed census totals match the saved outputs, but verdict classes still depend on reason-text parsing ([census script line 25](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/census/admission_census.py:25)). I did not independently verify every archived verdict, quote, estimate, or factual claim.
    12	
    13	**Yes, serious findings remain.**
