   136	- Successive periods of the same focus form a chain, such as Fed year-end 2026 rate → 2027 rate → 2028 rate. The chain records period order. Dependency traversal follows the rules above.
   137	- One thesis has at most one successor: FY2026 cannot produce two FY2027 successors.
   138	- Keep ladder orientation across succession: a strongly bullish first rung remains strongly bullish, although thresholds can change. Dependencies retain their direction; reversing the ends would break it.
